See \ref platformrte_docs_INTEGRATION "docs/INTEGRATION.dox" for detailed integration examples, or <a href="https://github.com/bula173/Platform_RTE/blob/master/CLAUDE.md">CLAUDE.md</a> for coding standards and safety practices.
